1
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,950
Hello, hello, the bubbles are here!

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,950
Tiny bubbles floating near!

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,950
Froggy, Ducky, Kitty too,

4
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,900
Butterfly, come dance with you!

5
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:15,950
Bubble up, bubble high,

6
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:17,900
Little bubbles in the sky!

7
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,950
Wiggle left and wiggle right,

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,900
Watch them sparkle, shiny bright!

9
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,950
Pop, pop, pop — clap your hands!

10
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,950
Hop, hop, hop — now make a stand!

11
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,950
Turn around and touch your toes,

12
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,280
Where the next bubble goes,

13
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,400
Nobody, nobody knows!

14
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:33,760
Bubble pop, bubble pop,

15
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:35,740
Dance until the bubbles drop!

16
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,760
Pop to the left, pop to the right,

17
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,800
Bubble dancing feels so right!

18
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,740
Bubble pop, bubble pop,

19
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,700
Clap your hands and never stop!

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:46,160
One, two, three — POP with me!

21
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:48,180
Happy as can be!

22
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,180
Froggy jumps — boing, boing, boing!

23
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,120
Ducky quacks — join, join, join!

24
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,180
Kitty wiggles — swish, swish, swish!

25
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,080
Butterfly makes a rainbow wish!

26
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:01,500
Big bubble, small bubble, floating around,

27
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,500
Bubbles go up, bubbles go down!

28
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,500
Reach up high, then touch the ground,

29
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,550
Pop a bubble — spin around!

30
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:11,380
Bubble pop, bubble pop,

31
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,280
Dance until the bubbles drop!

32
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,320
Pop to the left, pop to the right,

33
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:17,300
Bubble dancing feels so right!

34
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:19,260
Bubble pop, bubble pop,

35
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:21,160
Clap your hands and never stop!

36
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:23,620
One, two, three — POP with me!

37
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:25,580
Happy as can be!

38
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,080
Wiggle, wiggle!

39
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:31,080
Clap, clap, clap!

40
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,050
Hop, hop, hop!

41
00:01:32,050 --> 00:01:33,020
Tap, tap, tap!

42
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,970
Freeze like a statue — one, two, three!

43
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,980
Now pop a bubble — POP with me!

44
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,650
La-la-la, la-la-la!

45
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:47,950
Bye-bye bubbles, float away,

46
00:01:48,450 --> 00:01:51,950
We will dance another day!

47
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,600
Froggy, Ducky, Kitty too,

48
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,550
Butterfly says bye to you!
